{"step_index":199,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-13T00:54:42Z","input_tokens":2545,"cache_read_tokens":180443,"output_tokens":1978,"thinking":"The user likely searched for \"더플로우\" on 머니핀 and found a company in Haeundae-gu, Busan, identifying the business registration number 899-37-01327. Even if the representative's name and the specific corporate registration number differ from the initial data, the user's intended target is the \"더플로우\" listed as 1254 with (주)더플로우 and associated data.\n\n\nUser prioritizes matching business registration numbers based on company name (상호) and location (부산), even if the corporate registration number or representative name doesn't perfectly align. This suggests leveraging the business search tool to identify matches using 부산 as the area and the pure 상호 as a search term. Improved search script will focus on finding the business registration numbers in the returned results.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"const fs = require('fs');\n\nconst targets = JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync('target_companies.json', 'utf8'));\n\n// Clean name function\nfunction cleanCompanyName(name) {\n  return name\n    .replace(/\\(주\\)|\\(유한\\)|\\(유책\\)|\\(합자\\)|\\(사\\)/g, '')\n    .replace(/주식회사|유한회사/g, '')\n    .trim();\n}\n\nasync function searchBiznoForCompany(item) {\n  const cName = cleanCompanyName(item.name);\n  // 1st attempt: area=부산 & query=cName\n  // 2nd attempt: query=cName\n  const searchUrls = [\n    `https://bizno.net/?area=%EB%B6%80%EC%82%B0&query=${encodeURIComponent(cName)}`,\n    `https://bizno.net/?query=${encodeURIComponent(cName)}`\n  ];\n\n  for (const url of searchUrls) {\n    try {\n      const res = await fetch(url, {\n        headers: { 'User-Agent': 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64)' }\n      });\n      const html = await res.text();\n      const postListIdx = html.indexOf('post-list');\n      if (postListIdx === -1) continue;\n\n      const sidebarIdx = html.indexOf('class=\"col-lg-4 sidebar\"');\n      const searchSection = sidebarIdx !== -1 \n        ? html.substring(postListIdx, sidebarIdx) \n        : html.substring(postListIdx, postListIdx + 15000);\n\n      // Check if 0 results\n      if (searchSection.includes('0</span></strong> 개의 결과를 찾았습니다') || searchSection.includes('0 개의 결과를 찾았습니다')) {\n        continue;\n      }\n\n      // Find all single-posts in searchSection\n      const posts = searchSection.split('class=\"single-post');\n      if (posts.length <= 1) continue;\n\n      const candidates = [];\n      for (let i = 1; i < posts.length; i++) {\n        const post = posts[i];\n        const artMatch = post.match(/\\/article\\/(\\d{10})/);\n        const titleMatch = post.match(/<h4>([^<]+)<\\/h4>/);\n        const pMatch = post.match(/<p>([\\s\\S]*?)<\\/p>/);\n        const h5s = [...post.matchAll(/<h5>([^<]+)<\\/h5>/g)].map(m => m[1].trim());\n\n        if (artMatch) {\n          const bizNo = artMatch[1];\n          const title = titleMatch ? titleMatch[1].trim() : '';\n          const address = pMatch ? pMatch[1].replace(/<[^>]+>/g, '').trim() : '';\n          const ceoOrIndustry = h5s.join(' | ');\n\n          candidates.push({ bizNo, title, address, ceoOrIndustry });\n        }\n      }\n\n      if (candidates.length > 0) {\n        // Find best candidate\n        // Priority 1: address contains 부산 and title contains cName\n        let best = candidates.find(c => c.address.includes('부산') && c.title.includes(cName));\n        // Priority 2: title exactly equals cName\n        if (!best) best = candidates.find(c => c.title === cName);\n        // Priority 3: address contains 부산\n        if (!best) best = candidates.find(c => c.address.includes('부산'));\n        // Priority 4: first candidate\n        if (!best) best = candidates[0];\n\n        return {\n          found: true,\n          bizNo: best.bizNo,\n          formattedBizNo: best.bizNo.replace(/(\\d{3})(\\d{2})(\\d{5})/, '$1-$2-$3'),\n          matchedTitle: best.title,\n          matchedAddress: best.address,\n          matchedCeo: best.ceoOrIndustry,\n          url: `https://bizno.net/article/${best.bizNo}`\n        };\n      }\n    } catch (e) {\n      // error ignored\n    }\n    await new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, 200));\n  }\n\n  return { found: false, bizNo: null };\n}\n\nasync function run() {\n  console.log(`Starting smart bizno matching for ${targets.length} companies...`);\n  const results = [];\n\n  for (let i = 0; i < targets.length; i++) {\n    const item = targets[i];\n    const match = await searchBiznoForCompany(item);\n    results.push({\n      ...item,\n      ...match\n    });\n    console.log(`[${i+1}/${targets.length}] ${item.seq} ${item.name} (${item.ceo}) => ${match.found ? match.formattedBizNo + ' [' + match.matchedTitle + ']' : '미등록'}`);\n    await new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, 150));\n  }\n\n  fs.writeFileSync('smart_matched_results.json', JSON.stringify(results, null, 2), 'utf8');\n  console.log('Finished all!');\n}\n\nrun();\n","Description":"Script for smart bizno matching","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\worktrees\\resilient-bardeen\\parse_company_data\\smart_match_bizno.js","toolAction":"Writing smart_match_bizno.js","toolSummary":"Write smart bizno matching script"}}]}
