eplace(/\\(주\\)|\\(유한\\)|\\(유책\\)|\\(합자\\)|\\(사\\)/g, '').replace(/주식회사|유한회사/g, '').trim();\n    const url = `https://bizno.net/?query=${encodeURIComponent(cName)}`;\n\n    try {\n      const res = await fetch(url, { headers: { 'User-Agent': 'Mozilla/5.0' } });\n      const html = await res.text();\n      const postListMatch = html.match(/<div class=\"col-lg-8 post-list\">([\\s\\S]*?)<\\/div>\\s*<div class=\"col-lg-4 sidebar\">/);\n      \n      let matched = null;\n      if (postListMatch && !html.includes('0 개의 결과를 찾았습니다')) {\n        const items = postListMatch[1].split('class=\"single-post');\n        const list = [];\n        for (let j = 1; j < items.length; j++) {\n          const item = items[j];\n          const art = item.match(/\\/article\\/(\\d{10})/)?.[1];\n          const title = item.match(/<h4>([^<]+)<\\/h4>/)?.[1]?.trim() || '';\n          const p = item.match(/<p>([\\s\\S]*?)<\\/p>/)?.[1]?.replace(/<[^>]+>/g, '').replace(/\\s+/g, ' ').trim() || '';\n          const h5s = [...item.matchAll(/<h5>([^<]+)<\\/h5>/g)].map(m => m[1].trim());\n\n          const cleanTitle = title.replace(/\\(주\\)|\\(유한\\)|\\(유책\\)/g, '').replace(/주식회사|유한회사/g, '').trim();\n          if (art && (cleanTitle.includes(cName) || cName.includes(cleanTitle))) {\n            const ceoCand = h5s.find(h => h.length <= 4 && !h.includes('업') && !h.includes('소매') && !h.includes('제조') && !h.includes('서비스')) || '';\n            list.push({ bizNo: art, title, address: p, ceo: ceoCand });\n          }\n        }\n\n        // Rank list\n        // Priority 1: Address contains \"부산\" AND (address contains gu OR ceo matches first letter)\n        const targetGu = c.address.split(' ')[1]; // \"해운대구\", \"사상구\", etc.\n        const busanSameGu = list.find(item => item.address.includes('부산') && (item.address.includes(targetGu) || (item.ceo && c.ceo.startsWith(item.ceo[0]))));\n        const busanAny = list.find(item => item.address.includes('부산'));\n        const ceoMatchAnywhere = list.find(item => item.ceo && c.ceo.startsWith(item.ceo[0]) && cleanCompanyName(item.title) === cName);\n\n        if (busanSameGu) {\n          matched = { item: busanSameGu, type: '부산 동일구/대표자 일치' };\n        } else if (busanAny) {\n          matched = { item: busanAny, type: '부산 관내 상호일치' };\n        } else if (ceoMatchAnywhere) {\n          matched = { item: ceoMatchAnywhere, type: '상호 및 대표자 성명 일치' };\n        }\n      }\n\n      if (matched) {\n        matchReport.push({\n          seq: c.seq,\n          name: c.name,\n          ceo: c.ceo,\n          address: c.address,\n          matchedBizNo: matched.item.bizNo.replace(/(\\d{3})(\\d{2})(\\d{5})/, '$1-$2-$3'),\n          matchedTitle: matched.item.title,\n          matchedAddress: matched.item.address,\n          matchedCeo: matched.item.ceo,\n          confidence: matched.type,\n          status: '매칭성공'\n        });\n      } else {\n        matchReport.push({\n          seq: c.seq,\n          name: c.name,\n          ceo: c.ceo,\n          address: c.address,\n          matchedBizNo: '미등록(조회불가)',\n          confidence: '비즈노/머니핀 공공DB 사업자등록 미확인',\n          status: '미등록'\n        });\n      }\n    } catch (e) {\n      matchReport.push({\n        seq: c.seq,\n        name: c.name,\n        ceo: c.ceo,\n        address: c.address,\n        matchedBizNo: '미등록(조회불가)',\n        status: '에러'\n      });\n    }\n\n    await new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, 120));\n  }\n\n  fs.writeFileSync('final_matched_report.json', JSON.stringify(matchReport, null, 2), 'utf8');\n  console.log('Saved final_matched_report.json');\n}\n\nfunction cleanCompanyName(name) {\n  return name.replace(/\\(주\\)|\\(유한\\)|\\(유책\\)|\\(합자\\)|\\(사\\)/g, '').replace(/주식회사|유한회사/g, '').trim();\n}\n\ninspectCandidates();\n","Description":"Inspect and rank candidates strictly by user's 3 criteria","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\worktrees\\resilient-bardeen\\parse_company_data\\inspect_candidates.js","toolAction":"Writing candidate inspection script","toolSummary":"Write inspect_candidates.js"}}]}
